wip/openvkl: Import openvkl-2.0.2

Intel Open Volume Kernel Library: volume sampling and iteration
kernels (structured, unstructured, AMR, particle, VDB) used by OSPRay.
2.0.2 needs ISPC 1.30 and rkcommon 1.15.2.

The CPU device is built for the NEON2X (neon-i32x8) ISPC target on
aarch64, to pair with Embree's NEON2X build; only one NEON width can be
enabled.  The SYCL GPU device (Intel GPUs only) is off.  The examples
(vklTutorialCPU, vklTutorialISPC, vklMinimal_*, vklExamplesCPU with
GLFW/ImGui) are installed; the tests and benchmarks are not.
